v 3
d ssiv: Shift-Share Instrumental Variables Analysis
d
d Distribution-Date: 20251202
d
d This package implements shift-share (Bartik) instrumental variables
d estimation for Stata. It automates the construction of shift-share
d instruments and performs two-stage least squares estimation with
d comprehensive diagnostics.
d
d Key features:
d - Automatic shift-share IV construction
d - First-stage diagnostics and weak instrument tests
d - Support for clustering and robust standard errors
d - Comprehensive output and stored results
d
d Author: Claude Code
d Support: GitHub repository
d
d Requires: Stata version 14 or higher
d
d References:
d Bartik (1991), Goldsmith-Pinkham et al. (2020),
d Borusyak et al. (2022), Adão et al. (2019)
d
f ssiv.ado
f ssiv.sthlp
f example_ssiv.do
f SSIV_README.md
